---
import { Phone } from "@lucide/astro";
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";

const cardContainer =
  "bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl flex flex-col gap-16 border p-8 pb-12 md:p-4 md:pb-12";

const sectionLabel =
  "inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-4";

const contentStack = "flex flex-col gap-6";
const tightContentStack = "flex flex-col gap-4";

const paragraphClass = "text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed";

const listClass =
  "list-disc list-inside text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed flex flex-col gap-2";

const spanClass = "font-bold";
---

<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
  <div class={cardContainer}>
    <!-- Case Study -->
    <div>
      <span class={sectionLabel}>Case Study</span>
      <div class={tightContentStack}>
        <p class={paragraphClass}>
          A family-owned HVAC company generated consistent demand through Google
          Local Services Ads, Meta campaigns, and website inquiries—but response
          speed was holding them back.
        </p>
        <p class={paragraphClass}>
          During peak hours, evenings, and weekends, calls often went
          unanswered. Instead of a live conversation, prospects received
          automated texts, which many ignored.
        </p>
        <p class={paragraphClass}>
          Homeowners needing urgent service didn’t wait. They chose the first
          company that <span class={spanClass}>
            actually called them immediately.
          </span>
        </p>
        <p class={paragraphClass}>
          Staffing phones around the clock wasn’t financially realistic, and the
          existing team couldn’t keep pace with incoming demand.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Fix -->
    <div>
      <span class={sectionLabel}>The Fix</span>
      <div class={contentStack}>
        <p class={paragraphClass}>
          The company introduced an AI phone agent designed to respond to
          <span class={spanClass}>LSA and inbound leads immediately</span>,
          without adding headcount.
          <p class={paragraphClass}>
            Instead of delayed callbacks or unanswered calls, the AI <span
              class={spanClass}>
              answered or made calls within seconds
            </span>, engaging prospects while still actively searching.
            <p class={paragraphClass}>
              High-intent calls were instantly transferred to a technician or
              office staff member, ensuring no missed opportunities.
            </p>
          </p>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- How It Worked -->
    <div>
      <span class={sectionLabel}>How It Worked</span>
      <div class={contentStack}>
        <p class={paragraphClass}>
          The AI agent integrated seamlessly with the company’s existing tools,
          allowing every lead to be handled instantly without disrupting daily
          operations.
        </p>
        <ul class={listClass}>
          <li>
            <span class={spanClass}>Automatic CRM</span> lead creation with call logs
            and notes
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class={spanClass}>Google Local Services Ads integration</span> for
            calls and missed calls
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class={spanClass}>Immediate outbound calls</span> triggered by website
            form submissions
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class={spanClass}>Live call transfers</span> to technicians or office
            staff
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class={spanClass}>SMS and email alerts</span>for urgent or
            unanswered leads
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class={spanClass}>Real-time calendar</span> booking and scheduling
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class={spanClass}>Custom automations</span> for routing, follow-ups,
            and system updates
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Results -->
    <div>
      <span class={sectionLabel}>Results</span>
      <div class={contentStack}>
        <p class={paragraphClass}>
          Within the <span class={spanClass}>first week</span>, the company saw
          a <span class={spanClass}>
            20% increase in booked jobs and conversions
          </span> driven by faster response times and live conversations.

          <p class={paragraphClass}>
            In the <span class={spanClass}>first 30 days</span>, the company
            recovered an <span class={spanClass}>
              estimated $20,000 in revenue
            </span> by answering LSA calls that previously went to voicemail and contacting
            new leads while they were still actively searching.

            <p class={paragraphClass}>
              By replacing passive SMS-only follow-ups with immediate phone
              calls, there was a measurable advantage over competitors who
              relied on slow or inconsistent responses.
            </p>
          </p>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DEMO -->
    <div class="">
      <span class={cn(sectionLabel, "mb-0")}>Demo Voice Agent Number</span>
      <div class={cn(contentStack, "gap-0")}>
        <div class="flex gap-2 items-center">
          <Phone class="h-5 w-5 fill-primary border-none text-primary" />
          +1 (999) 999-9999
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Results -->
    <div>
      <p class={paragraphClass}>
        This technology is especially effective for industries where <span
          class={spanClass}>
          speed to lead matters more than volume,
        </span> including HVAC, plumbing, electrical, roofing, restoration, and other
        local service businesses running LSAs.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
